  "term": "retrograde ejaculation",
  "definition": "Retrograde ejaculation is a condition in which seminal fluid moves backward from the back part of the urethra into the bladder instead of flowing outward. It can happen because of nerve injury or disease, surgery in nearby tissues, or medication side effects.",
